    "\n",
    "**Instrucciones:**\n",
    "\n",
    "- Importa las librerías necesarias\n",
    "- Carga los archivos:\n",
    "  - `rappiplus_orders_raw.csv`\n",
    "  - `rappiplus_catalog.csv`\n",
    "  - `rappiplus_marketing_spend.csv`\n",
    "- Guarda los DataFrames en:\n",
    "  - `orders`, `catalog`, `marketing`\n",
    "- Explora cada dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
